htmlttf.gadget/HTML_SystemColors              htmlttf.gadget/HTML_SystemColors

   NAME
    HTML_SystemColors -- (BOOL) use screen colours for plain documents (V1)

   USAGE
    (OM_NEW, OM_SET, OM_GET)

   FUNCTION
    If TRUE, documents without <body bgcolor/text> are drawn with the
    screen's BACKGROUNDPEN/TEXTPEN instead of black on white. Default FALSE.
