htmlttf.gadget/HTMLTTF_FontDir                  htmlttf.gadget/HTMLTTF_FontDir

   NAME
    HTMLTTF_FontDir -- (STRPTR) directory with the .ttf files (V1)

   USAGE
    (OM_NEW, OM_GET)

   FUNCTION
    Default: the first of PROGDIR:fonts, FONTS:_TrueType, FONTS:TrueType and
